  <item>
    <title>006. 什么，你们不更新的时候都在做标本?</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698accb466e2c30377c6c59f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698accb466e2c30377c6c59f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 06:26:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>一群野人都会的事，做标本算一个！断更一年半回归，我们拉上好朋友湖鸦*聊聊做标本的故事、收获和矛盾。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*播客节目「垂直迁徙」主播；博物馆鸟类研究员，热衷于探索自然的演化与流动。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/时间轴/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 缘起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a> 狐臭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> 直观认识和意外发现</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>经鉴定，横斑林鸮吃的是夜蛾科的入侵物种Noctua pronuba，以幼虫形态越冬。</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a> 带本科生做标本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2264">37:44</a> 公益标本集训营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2697">44:57</a> 标本从哪来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3182">53:02</a> 自我冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3566">59:26</a> 标本是全人类的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4146">69:06</a> 极危和蜂鸟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4442">74:02</a> 石榴和北鲣鸟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4576">76:16</a> 湖鸦和紫崖燕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4668">77:48</a> 美润和企鹅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4971">82:51</a> Louis和小美洲黑雁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5178">86:18</a> 小石头感恩大家</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lphXErO_HAOl__-FpH6WBK0G6nfF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>湖鸦的劲敌 - 彩鹮 ©湖鸦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtlfH-qrdTfFd9zGvr9ywhRwdLY-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>博物馆里的蓝鸦们 ©湖鸦（更多标本美图请移步@Huia🍠）</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiUSBBvvBmPjmSFe_clRDGEcqY6Y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小石头、石榴、文韬、美润、极危和学生们做的撞玻璃的鸟 ©小石头</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgSp8Mh_LGNzo-XnNp8nYERQkzb8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>看不到鼻孔的北鲣鸟 ©石榴</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llycQ26BZJido_y6b5gB8LZ86aBW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>严师出高徒，极危做的第一个标本（左） ©极危</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhma0L5360ZjIqxsZduF4bOjnPgc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>做标本的美润在UC Davis CA&amp;ES官网</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/更多/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="【【羽宙公开课15】标本师带你看鸟类艺术和自然教育-哔哩哔哩】 https://b23.tv/KSeZ0qv" data-url="【【羽宙公开课15】标本师带你看鸟类艺术和自然教育-哔哩哔哩】 https://b23.tv/KSeZ0qv"><span>CBBS羽宙公开课15: 标本师带你看鸟类艺术和自然教育</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="【8月5日讲座回放《我在博物馆做标本》--极危物种-哔哩哔哩】 https://b23.tv/kwQLfOT" data-url="【8月5日讲座回放《我在博物馆做标本》--极危物种-哔哩哔哩】 https://b23.tv/kwQLfOT"><span>上海野鸟会 AM 讲座：我在博物馆做标本</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="【【晚安小鸟】天蓝色的小鸟会做什么梦？（山蓝鸲）-哔哩哔哩】 https://b23.tv/UvkowbX" data-url="【【晚安小鸟】天蓝色的小鸟会做什么梦？（山蓝鸲）-哔哩哔哩】 https://b23.tv/UvkowbX"><span>晚安小鸟</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ebd91f224325ea70e2ae00" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ebd91f224325ea70e2ae00"><span>「一群野人」限定返场！大家暑假里都在干嘛呢？</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65e936017f366086117fe3dd/lhMJ5Jr7fnBBbzwZZrg9NiZghL3F.m4a" length="85746636" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:28:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhLOgsB6Mt1QBY0r2Gkl-e9-lIL0.jpg"/>
