  <item>
    <title>005. 在沼泽抓鸟，在草原徒步，野保人都在做什么！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665e2a5563c334a2fb23709d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665e2a5563c334a2fb23709d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Jun 2024 04:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>五月，野人们迎来繁忙的野外季。第一周工作结束，在阿拉斯加、纽约州、加州、台湾的朋友们连线，分享喜悦、互倒苦水......</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/时间轴/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 介绍野外季工作内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="341">5:41</a> 野外季开始的信号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">7:41</a> 阿拉斯加令人惊喜的木头房子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">9:35</a> 大倒苦水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> 开心时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4003">66:43</a> 对未来工作的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4734">78:54</a> 对未来工作的期许</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4806">80:06</a> 畅想野外工作需要的超能力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/BGM/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>棕塍鹬警报©文韬、杂色鸫鸣唱©WFC111L、</span><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/255557221" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/255557221"><span>姬苇鳽</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/358307091" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/358307091"><span>珠颈斑鹑飞行</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/130946" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/130946"><span>绿胁绿霸鹟</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/62624461" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/62624461"><span>黄胸大䳭莺</span></a><span>、鸟调现场的工程车©美润、刺歌雀鸣唱©石榴</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrh0yKvkvc24te2P08r29ddJqDFp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>阿拉斯加工作现场 ©文韬、小石头</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpFIkVyffISGzGgFwjJdR-qlu0z7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>纽约州工作现场 ©石榴</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpaSBW1zYauXaMaJVvFYPPc0ct_S.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>加州工作现场 ©美润</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr9aO-z67YyrFQl3D5pY-JdXjU-W.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>黄缘闭壳龟（食蛇龟）©Louis</span></em></p>]]></description>
