  <item>
    <title>004. 上号！野人头像与展翅翱翔的那些事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662dbeaa5fb33c1b2b05d39e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662dbeaa5fb33c1b2b05d39e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Apr 2024 03:12:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>两个月前，“一群野人”面对几个logo草稿，意见无法统一。吵累了打Wingspan*时，石榴突发奇想：用Wingspan的头像吧！我们一拍即合。本期，我们聊聊各自头像的动物、Wingspan中的鸟类生活史，并畅想两栖爬行动物版。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*中文名《展翅翱翔》，一款桌游</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/时间轴/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> 石榴的刺歌雀：现代艺术和星战R2-D2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> 文韬的雪鸮：一日往返15小时推鸟被采访</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a> 小石头的棕塍鹬：牺牲完播率盛赞鸻鹬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">14:54</a> 极危的北极海鹦：钻石恒久远，海鹦永流传</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a> 美润的黄嘴喜鹊：不要忘记欣赏本地美鸟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1318">21:58</a> Louis的匹诺曹蜥蜴：雨林树冠层的罕见绿色蜥蜴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1567">26:07</a> Wingspan是一个下鸟的游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2033">33:53</a> 一鸟定胜负</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2442">40:42</a> 请Wingspan与eBird梦幻联动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">46:15</a> 头脑风暴两栖爬行动物版</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/BGM/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/451950661" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/451950661"><span>剪尾王霸鹟（Wingspan封面鸟）鸣唱</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/527284" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/527284"><span>刺歌雀鸣唱</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2-BKjnAgNgY" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2-BKjnAgNgY"><span>星战R2-D2</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/613466119" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/613466119"><span>歌带鹀飞鸣</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5eFvjgMP-LU" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5eFvjgMP-LU"><span>多米尼加树蛙蛙鸣</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrYNc5RXh36xIFeRSRxVkToijfzh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>刺歌雀中央尾羽带“刺” ©石榴</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsgd3DA-fH3UgIWiZ0grBzcE8U6n.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>2022年底到访加州的雪鸮 ©文韬</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtjCbltrD58G69vhVt1Snet2qM5l.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>34天大的棕塍鹬 ©小石头</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpNEIyjyKY8WdchbioeBaajcXwRv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>Anolis proboscis 匹诺曹蜥蜴 ©Louis</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrC1qzw7f5pZL19gYzD8Hy9xLZYQ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>@极危 画的黄嘴喜鹊logo ©MWFB</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lngHjgJV_Hw5tSKZUS3dAzP7nM_b.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>一群野人在Davis自习室打Wingspan ©小石头</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsBXEu19GzpmkxBTvmQr06fSZbuc.m4a" length="66213170" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhLOgsB6Mt1QBY0r2Gkl-e9-lIL0.jpg"/>
