  <item>
    <title>003. 野人全员毕业：在美国玩了四年，到底读出了个啥？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66135087c891c06e73ec2db1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66135087c891c06e73ec2db1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Apr 2024 02:03:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>“一群野人”是六个在UC Davis读书时因自然相识的好朋友：Vicky（@极危物种）、小石头、石榴（@梦失焦的石榴）、文韬、美润、Louis。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>如今，我们天各一方，每周通过“组会”分享近况、吃瓜、畅想未来······常常聊到有趣的野外经历、答案不唯一的保护问题。我们希望与更多人分享这些对话。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>欢迎加入“一群野人”的组会。</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>从初中到高中，生态与保护一直是教材末尾的一小章，只考送分题，不用学。美润毕业之际，“一群野人”怀念四年大学课堂，我们学了什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们的专业：Wildlife, Fish, and Conservation Biology (WFCB) </span><strong><span>野生动物、鱼类和保护生物学</span></strong><span>，Environmental Science and Management (ESM) </span><strong><span>环境科学与管理</span></strong><span>，Evolution, Ecology, and Biodiversity (EEB) </span><strong><span>进化、生态和生物多样性</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>/时间轴/</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> “我是学动物保护的！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> </span><a href="https://caes.ucdavis.edu/research/dept" data-url="https://caes.ucdavis.edu/research/dept"><span>环境科学的叛徒</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">09:31</a> 动物科学的叛徒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 野外实习遇上山火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> 专业入门课让人叛变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a> 认鸟考试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1713">28:33</a> 捞鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> WFCB和EEB的遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2266">37:46</a> “不务正业”的课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 给学弟学妹的建议：像美润一样E</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2522">42:02</a> 野人们的去向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2683">44:43</a> “那不就是玩儿吗？”</span></p><span></span><h2><span>/BGM/</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/95269511" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/95269511"><span>旅鸫</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/90666111" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/90666111"><span>白头鹎</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrUzJwo0HRupquL0eMrAor5q1hjy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>鸟类学实验课 ©小石头</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liQcnybnbcgU79Pr9OLtDUI4HwS-.m4a" length="46233527" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhLOgsB6Mt1QBY0r2Gkl-e9-lIL0.jpg"/>
