  <item>
    <title>002. Flaco之死——当圈养猫头鹰重获“自由”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f911c067649570792dadf5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f911c067649570792dadf5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Mar 2024 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>“一群野人”是六个在UC Davis读书时因自然相识的好朋友：Vicky（@极危物种）、小石头、石榴（@梦失焦的石榴）、文韬、美润、Louis。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>如今，我们天各一方，每周通过“组会”分享近况、吃瓜、畅想未来······常常聊到有趣的野外经历、答案不唯一的保护问题。我们希望与更多人分享这些对话。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>欢迎加入“一群野人”的组会。</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>在动物园长大的雕鸮Flaco被不法分子“放生”后，在拥挤的纽约自力更生，奇迹般地活了下来，成为自由的符号。今年2月底，Flaco疑似撞击玻璃后离世。本期，我们希望用观鸟、生态、保护的视角与你分享Flaco的传奇故事——他为什么能活下来？又因何成名？他的死会让纽约更加鸟类友好吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuild6WYvMpuhwZc2Lh_06e3poUb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>Flaco，2022年11月5日（左），2023年4月30日（右） ©小石头</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/时间轴/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> Flaco“自由”了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a> Free Flaco</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> Flaco抓到大老鼠，合理又不可思议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 猛禽救助视角——如何保证成功野放？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 雕鸮不属于纽约的自然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 抓还是不抓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a> Flaco是怎么火的？从鸟圈开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a> 隐藏猫头鹰坐标有必要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2303">38:23</a> 拍猫头鹰不需要闪光灯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2411">40:11</a> Flaco成为纽约人的精神寄托</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2841">47:21</a> Flaco失去中央公园的庇护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3194">53:14</a> FLACO (Feathered Lives Also Count) 法案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3301">55:01</a> 鸟撞和它的帮凶——光污染</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4134">68:54</a> 回顾：Flaco早已被判死缓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4334">72:14</a> 红山的“杜杜”火了，雨林友好产品呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4480">74:40</a> 从网红个体到种群和保护问题：美洲狮P-22的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4867">81:07</a> 小道消息</span></p><span></span><h2><span>/BGM/</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Wingspan</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/356577711" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/356577711"><span>仓鸮鬼叫</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/613763677" data-url="https://macaulaylibrary.org/asset/613763677"><span>雕鸮咕咕</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llB1QuleIjNc5pIzrqCQQuRSijei.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>东美角鸮，ISO 3200，f5.6，2.0s ©文韬</span></em></p>]]></description>
