    <title>001. 妇女节，从上厕所开始聊聊女性野外体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ea2bba8e6f71a5b7b76fe2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ea2bba8e6f71a5b7b76fe2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Mar 2024 21:03:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>“一群野人”是六个在UC Davis读书时因自然相识的好朋友：Vicky（@极危物种）、小石头、石榴（@梦失焦的石榴）、文韬、美润、Louis。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>如今，我们天各一方，每周通过“组会”分享近况、吃瓜、畅想未来······常常聊到有趣的野外经历、答案不唯一的保护问题。我们希望与更多人分享这些对话。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>欢迎加入“一群野人”的组会。</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期，我们聊聊在野外上厕所、来月经的难处，男性和女性被贴上了什么标签。野外环境特殊，工作不容易，我们希望打破月经禁忌和性别刻板印象，探讨如何更好地支持彼此。</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>/时间轴/</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 平时出野、野外工作是什么样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 怎么拉野屎、撒野尿，用旱厕的复杂心理活动，阿拉斯加野外工作拉野屎的选址难题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> 野外来月经怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 男性如何支持女性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a> 野外来月经的不同应对方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">18:28</a> 如何让野外工作安排更包容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 潮湿环境下女性野外工作的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1432">23:52</a> 水下工作来月经怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1594">26:34</a> 月经气味会吸引北极熊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a> 野外水资源有限时，来月经怎么清洁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1806">30:06</a> 月经卫生用品更像食物还是牙膏？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">31:47</a> 逐一击破野外工作时的性别刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">37:31</a> 跨性别女性可能碰到的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> 女性关于野外装备的烦恼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 祝大家妇女节快乐！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>/BGM/</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Wingspan</span></p>]]></description>
